    {
      "content": "For us we find the most effective way to like move a home safely and it and it like close to estimate as possible it just by sticking to like a two or three day move depending on what you actually need there a home like this I think the garage is probably gonna be the biggest game changer for us as far as determining whether or not you need that third day right now I can walk you through the typical numbers for a two day move. Cause what we would do is we would send you six movers on three trucks and just split the move up according to that the main reason why I think more than likely you'll need at least two days if you were to move with us it's just because of the drive time that you have between locations not that is an issue as far as like the logistics involved but it does put a bottle neck as far as like how long the day can be for the movers and how much of a workload they can actually accomplish per day right now. I would expect that six man team probably to have a nine hour day. That would probably be the best bet cause that'll get them as close to a true to form eight hour day. If the move where to be happening.",
